From c342ab9f18bbb7794f2f2d7aa89fe5a268aa7afb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritesh Pandit <riteshp2001@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 18:09:21 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 112/140] feat: Add haptic feedback support for various UI
 interactions

- Implemented haptic feedback for gesture controls in GestureHandler, enhancing user experience during volume and brightness adjustments.
- Introduced AppHaptics utility class to manage haptic feedback across the application.
- Added haptic feedback options in GesturePreferencesScreen, allowing users to enable or disable feedback.
- Integrated haptic feedback into PlaybackSpeedSheet, EqualizerSheet, and PlaylistSheet for improved interaction feedback.
- Created ReorderFeedback class to provide haptic feedback during drag-and-drop operations in the playlist.
- Added animated selection indicators in SelectionIndicator.kt to visually enhance item selection.
- Updated localization files to include new strings for haptic feedback settings.
